      "role": "user",
      "content": "The rain is cold on the ruins of Aethelgard. I’m sitting here among the broken pillars, just... looking at the sword. Everything is gone. My men, my queen, the light... it's all just ash now. I feel like the story has just run out of ink. There's nothing left to fight for, nothing left to say. It's just so quiet now.",
